    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p>Aggregates influence the strength and durability of pavements, making thorough testing before construction essential.</p>
<p>Our accredited laboratories and mobile facilities are equipped to perform the following aggregate services according to testing standards set by ASTM, SANAS, BSI and more.</p>]]></Value>
    </heroContent>
